  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: code injection in the netrw plugin via directory\n     history serialization: s:NetrwBookHistSave() wrote each directory\n     history entry into the generated .netrwhist script by concatenating\n     the raw value inside single quotes, so a directory name containing a\n     single quote and vimscript was evaluated when the history file was\n     sourced.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-47162.patch: quote the value with string()\n       so the history entry is emitted as a safe vimscript string literal,\n       in runtime/autoload/netrw.vim; matches upstream patch 9.2.0495.\n     - CVE-2026-47162",
